        and stumbling) scoped to SNOMED CT 217154006 (home/residential area, sport/exercise). Target SNOMED CT
        437175 = (concept_code 217154006), verified Athena for WHO ICD-10 W01. Place/activity
        subdivision has no individual SNOMED CT target; parent W01 subsumes it. One-level broader with
